WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.966
Yʋʋm wʋsg sẽn looge, kom-bɩɩg a ye yʋʋr sẽn boond t'a Samba ra be Sahel soolmẽ wã.

00:00:08.046 --> 00:00:11.597
A yaab-rãmbã ra kõ-a-la b zakã rũngã.

00:00:11.677 --> 00:00:24.648
Sẽn deng n kõ-a noor t'a looge, nin-kẽemã yeel-a lame: " Fo sã n wa ne f rũms zĩig ning fãa, tẽeg-y tɩ koomã ka be ned sẽn yũud-a ye.

00:00:24.728 --> 00:00:24.828
"

00:00:24.826 --> 00:00:27.788
Yʋʋmd kãnga, weerã yɩɩ kãsenga.

00:00:27.868 --> 00:00:32.203
La ko-kãsengã pʋgẽ, ko-yũudã ra lebgda bugum.

00:00:32.283 --> 00:00:40.544
A Samba ra kẽndda daar fãa n paasdẽ, la a na-kɩɩmsã ra yũuda rãam n kelemd n kelemdẽ.

00:00:40.624 --> 00:00:46.922
Daar a ye yʋngo, a yãa koom-koglg a ye sẽn da ket n pid ne koomã.

00:00:47.002 --> 00:00:51.044
Koɛɛgã ra yaa vẽenega, n kolg kiuugã pʋgẽ.

00:00:51.124 --> 00:00:58.894
B sẽn wa n na n yãgd-a wã, koomã koɛɛg n zẽk n yeele: Ãnna n tõe n kolg m ma wã?

00:00:58.974 --> 00:01:04.977
Ninsaal a ye n wa n yãend-a lame, t'a sõor yaa wa baobab tɩɩs.

00:01:05.057 --> 00:01:10.178
A Samba yɛɛsame wʋsgo, la a tẽega a yaab-rãmbã goama.

00:01:10.258 --> 00:01:15.968
A pʋʋs-a-la ne waoogre, n kos-a tɩ b kõ-a t'a rãam a piisã.

00:01:16.048 --> 00:01:26.271
A Zezi leokame n yeele: Kẽng-y tɩ m yũ, la bũmb a tãabo: Bɩ y na n zãgs y rũmsã, la y ra sãam m koomã ye.

00:01:26.351 --> 00:01:31.864
La bɩ y bas-a n kõ neb nins sẽn na n wa yãmb poorẽ wã ye.

00:01:31.944 --> 00:01:34.710
A Samba kõ-b-la koom tɩ b yũ.

00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:38.733
A maanda a sẽn tõe fãa n pids a sẽn datã.

00:01:38.813 --> 00:01:43.050
Vẽkembeoogo, pe-kɩɩm a to n wa ne piis wʋsg.

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:47.760
A ra yãgd-a lame, n digd a rũmsã fãa koglg pʋgẽ.

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:53.844
Kẽer zẽka bũmbu, la ko-kãsengã yikame, la koom-koglgã loogame.

00:01:53.924 --> 00:02:02.185
La pe-kɩɩmbã sẽn da yaa wuk-m-meng soaba, a sẽn wa n na n bas-a wã, a lebg n lebgame.

00:02:02.265 --> 00:02:10.624
Ninsaalã leb n goma ne a Samba n yeele: " Fo sẽn da waoogd koomã, fo na n paama koomã.

00:02:10.704 --> 00:02:19.161
" La b yetame tɩ sã n wa yaa kiid wakat fãa, Samba ra paamda koom-koglgã zĩig a yembre.

00:02:19.241 --> 00:02:26.913
A sẽn lebg kãsenga, a leb n togsa a yagensã a ba wã goama, n paas a meng goama.

00:02:26.993 --> 00:02:29.660
Fo sã n namsd-a, a loogdame.
